<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38066" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαν-αίρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lift up, raise high,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς κεφαλάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					6.23
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κἀπαναίρονται δόρυ</span> (<i><span class="en">
				Herm.
			</span></i> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κἀπαναιροῦνται</span>)
				<i>raise</i> the spear <i>one against the other,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				424
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανήρατο τὴν βακτηρίαν</span>
			<i>raised his</i> staff <i>against</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.84
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανήραντο</span>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>rise up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλ᾽ ἐπαναίρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					784
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
